{
  "about": "拦截列表一行规则会变成什么：服务端（crates/panel-server/src/blocklist.rs）解析订阅的列表、页面（web/src/config-model/blocklist.ts）解析自己写的规则，两边都拿这些用例测。rules 为空数组是这一行不算规则（注释、本机条目），skip 是这一行没用上的原因。含义照 https://adguard-dns.io/kb/general/dns-filtering-syntax/ / What one blocklist line becomes: the server parses subscribed lists and the page parses one's own rules, and both are tested on these cases. An empty rules array means the line is no rule (a comment, a local entry); skip is why a line went unused.",
  "lines": [
